repository-code: "https://github.com/khayoubIsmail/llm-web-agents-survey-evidence"
abstract: >
  Evidence and experiment package for the survey on LLM-based Web agents and
  schema-guided data extraction. The release contains the 805-study mapping
  corpus, the 454-study publication-eligible pool, the historical 403-record
  note set, the final 386-study qualitative synthesis (385 retained historical
  synthesis studies plus one documented revision-stage scope re-adjudication),
  paper-level notes and synthesis sources, claim-level evidence files, a formal
  field-provenance schema, and the controlled 108-run wireless-headphones experiment.
keywords:
  - LLM agents
  - Web automation
  - data extraction
  - systematic mapping
  - provenance
  - survey
